    "ledger": [
      {
        "id": "E0",
        "kind": "feed",
        "text": "Ask Claude about your money and get straight answers from the accounts you connect.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "• • • • • • • • • Introducing Personal Finance in Claude | Claude by Anthropic • • • • •",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With Personal Finance in Claude, you can securely connect your bank and card accounts and ask in your own words.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Access is read-only, and Personal Finance can’t move, manage, or invest your money.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Like the rest of Claude , Personal Finance has no ads or sponsored recommendations, and it doesn’t offer credit cards, loans, or savings accounts of its own, so your money questions get a straight answer.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Personal Finance starts rolling out in beta this week, on the Pro, Max, and Ultra plans in the US.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Say it's late in the month and payday is still 10 days away.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In this example, that comes to $4,309.37, with more than half going to rent and utilities and $1,024.51 to food and drink.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Then Claude tells you about four payments that will come out of your checking account before payday, and what you’ll have left: $1,393.22.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Personal Finance helps you understand your money, and it isn't designed to give investment advice.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "That's where you agree to its terms and approve Claude's read-only access, so Claude doesn't ask for or see your bank password.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When you chat with Claude in the Personal Finance hub, those conversations aren't used to train our models.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When you see Personal Finance in Claude's sidebar, open it, connect one account, and ask a single question, like \"Can I afford a trip this spring?\" or \"How much could I save each month?\" You'll find the setup steps, and how your data is used and kept, in the Help Center.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-personal-finance-in-claude",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:27.695Z"
      }
    ],
